
[l_english.DECISION_C12_INCREASE_TRADE_WITH_APPLELOOSA]
Increase trade with Appleloosa

[l_english.DECISION_C12_INCREASE_TRADE_WITH_APPLELOOSA_desc]
We have mineral resources under our hooves, and they have more than enough apples. By engaging in friendly trade under exceptionally favorable terms, we can perfectly complement each other’s needs — and at the same time, let both sides understand what the two families can achieve economically when united as one.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_INCREASE_TRADE_WITH_APPLELOOSA]
增大与苹果鲁萨的贸易往来

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_INCREASE_TRADE_WITH_APPLELOOSA_desc]
我们蹄上有矿产，他们蹄上有足够多的苹果，以极其优惠的条件与他们进行友好的贸易，我们完全可以互补所需，同时也让双方都明白，俩家族团结一致在经济上能取得的成就。
